---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Quote from '../components/Quote.astro';
import { episodes } from '../data/media';
---

<Base
  title="Centennial Podcast"
  description="Five podcast episodes created, hosted and voiced entirely by NDSAI Bal Vikas students to mark the centenary of Bhagawan Sri Sathya Sai Baba."
  image="/img/centenary/centenary-emblem.webp"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Centenary celebrations"
    title="The NDSAI students’ podcast"
    lede="Created, hosted and voiced entirely by our Bal Vikas students. Each episode explores one of Baba’s teachings, connects it to daily life, and invites families to practise it together."
  >
    <p class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white ring-1 ring-white/20">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-saffron-400"></span>
      All five episodes are live
    </p>
  </PageHero>

  <Section width="narrow">
    <div class="reveal grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] sm:items-center">
      <img
        src="/img/centenary/centenary-emblem.webp"
        alt="Centenary emblem marking one hundred years of Bhagawan Sri Sathya Sai Baba"
        width="900"
        height="900"
        class="mx-auto w-36 sm:w-44"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <div class="rich !mt-0">
        <p class="!text-lg">
          The year 2025 marked a divine opportunity to live His message with renewed inspiration. Swami reminded us
          that children are the torchbearers of truth and transformation, and that when their hearts are shaped by
          values, society itself becomes stronger.
        </p>
        <p>
          Please enjoy, listen, forward, get involved, and encourage your students and friends to put these practices
          into effect. Om Sairam.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="sand" width="narrow" class="!pt-0 !mt-16">
    <ol class="space-y-5">
      {
        episodes.map((episode) => (
          <li class="reveal rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 ring-1 ring-sand-200 sm:p-7">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-ink-900 font-display text-lg font-bold text-saffron-300">
                {episode.number}
              </span>
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold sm:text-2xl">{episode.title}</h2>
                <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink-700">{episode.blurb}</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <audio
              controls
              preload="none"
              class="mt-5 w-full"
              aria-label={`Episode ${episode.number}: ${episode.title}`}
            >
              <source src={episode.src} type={episode.type} />
              <a href={episode.src} download>
                Download episode {episode.number}
              </a>
            </audio>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
  </Section>

  <Section width="narrow" class="!pt-0 !mt-16">
    <Quote size="large">
      If a wave of service sweeps over the land, catching everyone in its enthusiasm, it will be able to wipe off the
      mounds of hatred, malice and greed that infest the World. Attune your hearts so that they will vibrate in
      sympathy with the woes and joys of your fellow-men. Fill the World with Love.
    </Quote>
  </Section>
</Base>
